{"id":"nacido","lemma":"nacido","pos":"adj","rank":1816,"glosses":["born, alive","natural, inborn, innate"],"ipa":"/naˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"nacida","masculinePlural":"nacidos","femininePlural":"nacidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-nacido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Desearía que nunca hubieras nacido.","en":"I wish you'd never been born.","words":[{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Desearía haber nacido canadiense.","en":"I wish I'd been born Canadian.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302342","words":[{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to have"},null,{"g":"Canadian"}]},{"text":"El hombre estaba avergonzado de haber nacido pobre.","en":"The man was ashamed of being born poor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688907","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"embarrassed, ashamed"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to have"},null,{"g":"poor"}]},{"text":"Ella deseó haber nacido veinte años atrás.","en":"She wished she had been born twenty years earlier.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to have"},null,{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"year","l":"año"},{"g":"behind"}]},{"text":"¿Cuánta gente nacida en el siglo XIX seguirá viviendo hoy en día?","en":"I wonder how many people born in the 19th century are still alive.","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},{"g":"people"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"century"},null,{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[9,12,"nowadays"]]}]}